    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be the area of the region</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>And solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now on plotting the diagram of the above region we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0059_a02617e3e83a.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 437px;\" /></p><p>Now from the above diagram area of the shaded region will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>108</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns